WEBVTT

00:00:07.748 --> 00:00:09.010
It's a bit strange,
isn't it?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.665
Strange?

00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:14.233
You hear this voice,
a voice only you can hear,

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:17.497
and then Mrs. Norris
turns up Petrified.

00:00:17.497 --> 00:00:19.107
It's just...strange.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:21.327
Do you think
I should have told them,

00:00:21.327 --> 00:00:22.807
Dumbledore and the others,
I mean?

00:00:22.807 --> 00:00:24.025
Are you mad?

00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:25.113
No, Harry.

00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:26.898
Even in the wizarding world,

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:30.815
hearing voices
isn't a good sign.

00:00:30.815 --> 00:00:33.513
She's right, you know.

00:00:38.344 --> 00:00:40.651
Could I have
your attention, please?

00:00:40.651 --> 00:00:42.348
Right.

00:00:42.348 --> 00:00:47.005
Now, today,
we will be transforming animals

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.441
into water goblets.

00:00:50.138 --> 00:00:52.489
Like so.

00:00:52.489 --> 00:00:55.100
One, two, three.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.231
Vera Verto.

00:00:58.756 --> 00:01:00.192
CHILDREN:
Whoa!

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:02.542
Now it's your turn.

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:04.718
Who would
like to go first?

00:01:04.718 --> 00:01:07.547
Ah, Mr. Weasley.
"One, two, three.

00:01:07.547 --> 00:01:08.809
Vera Verto."

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:13.553
Ahem.

00:01:13.553 --> 00:01:15.773
Vera Verto.

00:01:15.773 --> 00:01:17.514
[SQUEAKING]

00:01:20.995 --> 00:01:24.608
That wand needs replacing,
Mr. Weasley.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.349
Yes, Miss Granger?

00:01:27.349 --> 00:01:29.874
Professor, I was wondering
if you could tell us

00:01:29.874 --> 00:01:31.136
about the Chamber of Secrets.

00:01:38.709 --> 00:01:40.014
Very well.

00:01:40.014 --> 00:01:42.539
Well, you all know,
of course,

00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:47.892
that Hogwarts was founded
over a thousand years ago

00:01:47.892 --> 00:01:52.157
by the four greatest
witches and wizards of the age:

00:01:52.157 --> 00:01:56.074
Godric Gryffindor,
Helga Hufflepuff,

00:01:56.074 --> 00:02:01.949
Rowena Ravenclaw
and Salazar Slytherin.

00:02:01.949 --> 00:02:08.956
Now, three of the founders
coexisted quite harmoniously.

00:02:08.956 --> 00:02:10.262
One did not.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:11.829
Three guesses who.

00:02:11.829 --> 00:02:15.310
Salazar Slytherin
wished to be more selective

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:17.182
about the students
admitted to Hogwarts.

00:02:17.182 --> 00:02:20.838
He believed magical learning

00:02:20.838 --> 00:02:23.580
should be kept
within all-magic families.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.320
In other words, pure-bloods.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:32.197
Unable to sway the others,
he decided to leave the school.

00:02:32.197 --> 00:02:35.417
Now, according to legend,

00:02:35.417 --> 00:02:38.943
Slytherin had built
a hidden chamber in this castle

00:02:38.943 --> 00:02:42.424
known as the Chamber of Secrets.

00:02:42.424 --> 00:02:46.167
Well, shortly before departing,
he sealed it,

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:47.865
until that time

00:02:47.865 --> 00:02:50.998
when his own true Heir
returned to the school.

00:02:50.998 --> 00:02:55.612
The Heir alone would be able
to open the Chamber

00:02:55.612 --> 00:02:59.616
and unleash the horror within,

00:02:59.616 --> 00:03:01.182
and by so doing,

00:03:01.182 --> 00:03:03.402
purge the school
of all those who,

00:03:03.402 --> 00:03:09.669
in Slytherin's view,
were unworthy to study magic.

00:03:09.669 --> 00:03:11.236
Muggle-borns.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:17.808
Well, naturally, the school
has been searched many times.

00:03:17.808 --> 00:03:20.767
No such chamber has been found.

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.943
Professor?

00:03:22.943 --> 00:03:26.033
What exactly does legend tell us
lies within the Chamber?

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:30.124
The Chamber is said
to be home to something

00:03:30.124 --> 00:03:33.171
that only the Heir of Slytherin
can control.

00:03:33.171 --> 00:03:36.435
It is said to be the home...

00:03:36.435 --> 00:03:39.133
of a monster.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.924
Do you think it's true?

00:03:46.924 --> 00:03:49.013
Do you think there really is
a Chamber of Secrets?

00:03:49.013 --> 00:03:51.058
Yes. Couldn't you tell?

00:03:51.058 --> 00:03:53.408
McGonagall's worried.
All the teachers are.

00:03:53.408 --> 00:03:55.193
But if there really is
a Chamber of Secrets,

00:03:55.193 --> 00:03:57.369
and it really has been opened,
then that means...

00:03:57.369 --> 00:03:59.153
The Heir of Slytherin
has returned to Hogwarts.

00:03:59.153 --> 00:04:01.155
The question is...
who is it?

00:04:01.155 --> 00:04:03.201
Let's think.

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:05.725
Who do we know who thinks
all Muggle-borns are scum?

00:04:05.725 --> 00:04:07.292
If you're talking about Malfoy--

00:04:07.292 --> 00:04:10.469
Of course! You heard him.
"You'll be next, Mudbloods."

00:04:10.469 --> 00:04:13.733
I heard him. But Malfoy,
the Heir of Slytherin?

00:04:13.733 --> 00:04:16.301
Maybe Ron's right, Hermione.
I mean, look at his family.

00:04:16.301 --> 00:04:17.650
The whole lot of them

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.956
have been in Slytherin
for centuries.

00:04:18.956 --> 00:04:21.654
Crabbe and Goyle must know.

00:04:21.654 --> 00:04:23.134
Maybe we could trick them
into telling.

00:04:23.134 --> 00:04:25.745
Even they aren't
that thick,

00:04:25.745 --> 00:04:28.095
but there might
be another way.

00:04:28.095 --> 00:04:30.010
Mind you, it would
be difficult,

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.272
not to mention
we'd be breaking

00:04:31.272 --> 00:04:33.274
about 50 school rules.

00:04:33.274 --> 00:04:34.449
And it'll be dangerous.

00:04:34.449 --> 00:04:37.583
Very dangerous.

00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:46.810
Here it is,
The Polyjuice Potion.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.246
"Properly brewed,

00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:49.769
"the Polyjuice Potion
allows the drinker

00:04:49.769 --> 00:04:51.510
"to transform himself
temporarily

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:54.078
into the physical form
of another."

00:04:54.078 --> 00:04:56.210
You mean if Harry and I
drink that stuff,

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.385
we'll turn into
Crabbe and Goyle?

00:04:57.385 --> 00:04:58.909
Yes.
Wicked.

00:04:58.909 --> 00:05:00.737
Malfoy'll
tell us anything.

00:05:00.737 --> 00:05:03.000
Exactly, but it's tricky.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.219
I've never seen
a more complicated potion.

00:05:05.219 --> 00:05:07.352
HARRY: Well, how long
will it take to make?

00:05:07.352 --> 00:05:09.006
A month.

00:05:09.006 --> 00:05:11.399
A month?

00:05:11.399 --> 00:05:14.359
But, Hermione, if Malfoy
is the Heir of Slytherin,

00:05:14.359 --> 00:05:15.882
he could attack

00:05:15.882 --> 00:05:18.232
half the Muggle-borns
in the school by then.

00:05:18.232 --> 00:05:20.321
I know....

00:05:20.321 --> 00:05:23.324
but it's the only plan
we've got.

00:05:23.324 --> 00:05:25.457
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:05:25.457 --> 00:05:27.894
[♪♪♪]

